<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 13:38:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>指标不可避免的弱点</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-inevitable-weakness-of-metrics</link><description>量化我们的生活比以往任何时候都容易。但一位游戏哲学家警告说，外部指标和数据永远无法捕捉到真正重要的东西。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-inevitable-weakness-of-metrics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 13:38:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-inevitable-weakness-of-metrics</guid></item><item><title>IL-1途径可能会阻止念珠菌在免疫力减弱时变得致命</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/il-1-pathway-may-stop-candida-fungus-from-turning-fatal-in-weakened-immunity</link><description>人们发现了一种免疫途径，可以防止通常无害的真菌发展成致命的感染。伦敦国王学院的研究，发表于&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/il-1-pathway-may-stop-candida-fungus-from-turning-fatal-in-weakened-immunity2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 13:23:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/il-1-pathway-may-stop-candida-fungus-from-turning-fatal-in-weakened-immunity</guid></item><item><title>通过酶促去糖化逆转蛋白质化学老化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/reversal-of-protein-chemical-aging-by-enzymatic-deglycation</link><description>等人。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/reversal-of-protein-chemical-aging-by-enzymatic-deglycation2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 13:08:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/reversal-of-protein-chemical-aging-by-enzymatic-deglycation</guid></item><item><title>研究公司表示，DeepSeek 的新人工智能模型是迄今为止运行成本最便宜的知名模型</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/deepseeks-new-ai-model-is-by-far-the-cheapest-of-wellknown-models-to-run-research-firm-says</link><description>据一家研究公司称，中国初创公司 DeepSeek 的旗舰人工智能模型的一个版本是迄今为止全球知名模型中基准测试运行成本最低的，比 Anthropic 的 Claude Fable 5 的运行成本便宜 100 多倍。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/deepseeks-new-ai-model-is-by-far-the-cheapest-of-wellknown-models-to-run-research-firm-says.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:53:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/deepseeks-new-ai-model-is-by-far-the-cheapest-of-wellknown-models-to-run-research-firm-says</guid></item><item><title>用于肺炎诊断的床旁超声检查</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/point-of-care-ultrasound-for-the-diagnosis-of-pneumonia</link><description>本篇《JAMA 见解》探讨了使用床旁超声作为胸部 X 光检查和计算机断层扫描的一种更便宜、更容易的替代方法来诊断社区获得性肺炎。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/point-of-care-ultrasound-for-the-diagnosis-of-pneumonia.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:38:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/point-of-care-ultrasound-for-the-diagnosis-of-pneumonia</guid></item><item><title>恢复唾液流动可以改善唐氏综合症患者的口腔健康</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/restoring-saliva-flow-may-improve-oral-health-in-down-syndrome</link><description>然而，卡彭特并不完全相信唾液分泌不足会导致牙周炎。 “我认为关于人类研究的文献中没有太多证据证明这一点，”他说。相反，他说 Dp16 唾液腺中存在的炎症可能会导致唾液分泌不足。 “有很多文献表明炎症细胞可以影响唾液分泌，”他指出。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/restoring-saliva-flow-may-improve-oral-health-in-down-syndrome.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:23:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/restoring-saliva-flow-may-improve-oral-health-in-down-syndrome</guid></item><item><title>人工智能和量子计算机将是亦敌亦友</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-and-quantum-computers-will-be-frenemies</link><description>这两种技术看起来更具互补性而不是竞争性&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-and-quantum-computers-will-be-frenemies.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:08:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-and-quantum-computers-will-be-frenemies</guid></item><item><title>慢性压力和头痛：HPA 轴和自主神经系统的作用</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chronic-stress-and-headaches-the-role-of-the-hpa-axis-and-autonomic-nervous-system</link><description>慢性压力显着影响头痛疾病的发病机制，影响着全世界数百万人。这篇综述探讨了压力和头痛之间的复杂关系，重点关注下丘脑-垂体-肾上腺 (HPA) 轴和自主神经系统 (ANS) 的失调。持续的压力可能导致神经炎症、疼痛敏感性增加以及血管变化，从而导致头痛的发生和进展。这种关系的双向性质造成了恶性循环，反复出现的头痛成为额外压力的来源。 HPA 轴失调和 ANS 失衡可能会加剧头痛的易感性，从而加剧头痛的频率和严重程度。虽然药物干预措施仍然很常见，但以减轻压力为目标的非药物方法，例如认知行为疗法、生物反馈和放松技术，为全面的头痛管理提供了有希望的途径。通过解决潜在的压力相关机制，这些方法提供了减少头痛频率和改善患者生活质量的可持续策略。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chronic-stress-and-headaches-the-role-of-the-hpa-axis-and-autonomic-nervous-system.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:53:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chronic-stress-and-headaches-the-role-of-the-hpa-axis-and-autonomic-nervous-system</guid></item><item><title>JCI：免疫学和炎症系，伦敦帝国学院，伦敦，英国</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jci-department-of-immunology-and-inflammation-imperial-college-london-london-united-kingdom</link><description>2&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/jci5.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:38:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jci-department-of-immunology-and-inflammation-imperial-college-london-london-united-kingdom</guid></item><item><title>小鼠研究表明利拉鲁肽如何短暂地重新连接肠道细菌群落</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mouse-study-shows-how-liraglutide-briefly-rewires-gut-bacterial-communities</link><description>研究人员用利拉鲁肽治疗雄性高脂喂养小鼠 14 天，然后在 7 天的清除后使用 16S rRNA 测序追踪粪便细菌群落。利拉鲁肽使微生物群转向乳杆菌和细颗粒单胞菌相关类群，同时减少了几种发酵类群，但在治疗停止后，大多数变化又回到了基线。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mouse-study-shows-how-liraglutide-briefly-rewires-gut-bacterial-communities.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:23:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mouse-study-shows-how-liraglutide-briefly-rewires-gut-bacterial-communities</guid></item></channel></rss>